    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sorcery and Survival is an exciting arena shooter where you play as a powerful wizard who controls his destiny in a world of magic and danger. Your task is to repel waves of enemies, learn ancient spells and master new magical abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore mysterious lands full of riddles and symbolic creatures. Discover powerful spells that will help you defend yourself from enemies and endure difficult trials. Your learned spell will lead you to the pinnacle of magical mastery, but be prepared for unexpected challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique spell learning system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay with renewable energy sources</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of magical locations and opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic magic management and strategic planning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sorcery and Survival&quot; invites you to get comfortable in a world of magic and trials. Are you ready to become a master of magic and overcome all the difficulties that will come your way?</p>",
